  "fareInfo": "Distance-based fares from ¥2 for the first 4 km; most central trips cost ¥2–5 and the long airport run is ~¥7–10 (2026). The easiest way to pay is the metro QR code in Alipay or WeChat Pay, both of which accept linked foreign Visa/Mastercard cards. You can also buy single-trip tokens with cash at station machines and counters, or use a Hangzhou transit card. 1-, 3-, 5- and 7-day passes exist. Expect bag security checks at every station.",
