    {
      "name": "Hangzhou Xiaoshan International Airport",
      "code": "HGH",
      "lat": 30.2387,
      "lng": 120.4296,
      "transitNote": "About 27 km east of the centre. Metro Line 19 (airport express, on this map) reaches Hangzhou East Railway Station in ~25 min and continues to West Lake Cultural Square and Hangzhou West; Line 1 runs all the way to Longxiangqiao (West Lake) in ~65 min without changing, and Line 7 to Wushan Square. Taxi or DiDi to West Lake ~45–60 min, ~¥100–150 (pick-up in the ride-hailing zone of the car park).",
      "hours": "Metro ~6:00 AM until a last train ~11:00–11:15 PM; later arrivals use airport coaches or taxis."
